(7250533, 1126201, 93565, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. The light actually works quite well, simulating a true copy machine. Serendipity at its best, congrats.</td>', 'Excellent photo. The light actually works quite well, simulating a true copy machine. Serendipity at its best, congrats.', '2014-08-12 00:47:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7250634, 1126201, 24454, '<td valign="top">OHMYGOSH... this is so delightful!  Those girls look like they are having a blast!  I think you must be a very fun photographer for a kid to work with.   Their radiant smiles make me happy just to look at this!<br/></td>', 'OHMYGOSH... this is so delightful!  Those girls look like they are having a blast!  I think you must be a very fun photographer for a kid to work with.   Their radiant smiles make me happy just to look at this!', '2014-08-12 14:51:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7250930, 1126201, 149952, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo and also a little spooky as we have a mini studio in our house with identical walls, floor and skirting boards.</td>', 'Fantastic photo and also a little spooky as we have a mini studio in our house with identical walls, floor and skirting boards.', '2014-08-13 04:16:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7251007, 1126189, 19825, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done on all fronts -- technically, compositionally -- and the photographer did a nice job as the model, too. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Very nicely done on all fronts -- technically, compositionally -- and the photographer did a nice job as the model, too. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2014-08-13 12:32:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7251119, 1126133, 12611, '<td valign="top">So crisp and tecnically beautiful- which certainly is a function of a great composition as well.  I am liking your set-up a great deal lately.</td>', 'So crisp and tecnically beautiful- which certainly is a function of a great composition as well.  I am liking your set-up a great deal lately.', '2014-08-13 18:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7252126, 1126213, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, a fine image.</td>', 'Congratulations, a fine image.', '2014-08-17 05:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7252295, 1126201, 24983, '<td valign="top">great shot up there with the "cat scan"</td>', 'great shot up there with the "cat scan"', '2014-08-18 00:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255052, 1126071, 119012, '<td valign="top">critique club:<br/> <br/>can i ask why you shot f/10?<br/> <br/>at that distance you dont need the DOF of f10, you could have open up and gotten a cleaner sky that shooting at ISO 4000.<br/> <br/>composition wise its nice, just enough negative space on the right and top. nicely captured too with no blurring of the planes.</td>', 'critique club: can i ask why you shot f/10? at that distance you dont need the DOF of f10, you could have open up and gotten a cleaner sky that shooting at ISO 4000. composition wise its nice, just enough negative space on the right and top. nicely captured too with no blurring of the planes.', '2014-08-25 13:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255053, 1126173, 119012, '<td valign="top">critique club:<br/> <br/>i find it interesting to look at, im not sure what it says to me though. the image feels a bit heavily weighted to the top as you kind of lose the border the frame provides on the bottom. its clean and sharp, the highlight on the limes are a bit hot but otherwise well exposed..</td>', 'critique club: i find it interesting to look at, im not sure what it says to me though. the image feels a bit heavily weighted to the top as you kind of lose the border the frame provides on the bottom. its clean and sharp, the highlight on the limes are a bit hot but otherwise well exposed..', '2014-08-25 13:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255054, 1125647, 119012, '<td valign="top">critique club:<br/> <br/>nice capture of an interesting bird, the reflection is muddy and doesn''t really match the colorful nature on the main subject. that probably my problem with this image as it need more vibrant lighting it has a very dreary feeling to a non dreary subject</td>', 'critique club: nice capture of an interesting bird, the reflection is muddy and doesn''t really match the colorful nature on the main subject. that probably my problem with this image as it need more vibrant lighting it has a very dreary feeling to a non dreary subject', '2014-08-25 13:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255055, 1126207, 119012, '<td valign="top">critique club:<br/> <br/>i feel like its going to slide right off the table. to be honest its doesnt''t do much for me, its needs a more interesting perspective or something...</td>', 'critique club: i feel like its going to slide right off the table. to be honest its doesnt''t do much for me, its needs a more interesting perspective or something...', '2014-08-25 13:25:43.000000', NULL, 0);
